 with an empty `slot_grip` there, under `root`, and the sling hangs along -Y from the grip. Turned -90 about X to the held convention, as obsidian_handaxe_held.\n\n- Clips: `sling_throw`, `idle`.\n- Length: 37 cm.\n- Cubes: 3.\n- Texture: 128x64, the monster's own sheet cropped to the faces used."}